1. Getting Started 

1.1 Creating an Account 

Open the CarShare app. 

Select “Create Account.” 

Enter your full name and AUBH email address (only @aubh.edu is accepted). 

Create a strong password. 

Check your email for a verification code. 

Enter the code into the app to complete registration. 

 

1.2 Logging In 

Open the app. 

Enter your registered AUBH email and password. 

Select “Log In.” 

You will be directed to the home dashboard. 

 

2. Posting a Ride (Driver Functionality) 

Use this feature if you want to offer seats to other students. 

On the dashboard, tap “Post a Ride.” 

Enter the required ride details: 

Pickup area (not exact address) 

Destination 

Date and time 

Number of available seats 

Optional car details 

Review your information. 

Select “Create Ride.” 

Your ride will now appear in the ride listings for students searching for matching routes. 

 

3. Browsing and Searching Rides (Rider Functionality) 

From the main menu, select “Find a Ride.” 

Filter or browse rides by: 

Pickup area 

Destination 

Time 

Select a ride to view: 

Driver name 

Available seats 

Pickup meeting point 

Ride date and time 

CarShare only shows general areas, not private addresses, to protect user privacy. 

 

4. Booking a Seat 

Open a ride listing. 

Review the ride details. 

Tap “Book Seat.” 

Confirm your booking. 

The system will automatically reduce the available seat count. 

Important: 
You cannot book a seat if: 

No seats are available 

The ride time has already passed 

You have already booked a seat in the same ride 

Drivers will receive your booking information after confirmation. 

 

5. Verifying Your Driver on Pickup 

To ensure safety, each ride generates a unique driver verification code. 

When you book a ride, you receive the verification code. 

When the driver arrives, ask them to provide the same code. 

Only board the ride if the codes match. 

This process reduces risks like impersonation or entering the wrong vehicle. 

 

6. Viewing Your Ride History 

6.1 As a Rider 

Open “My Rides.” 

View upcoming and past rides. 

Select a ride to see details or cancel. 

6.2 As a Driver 

Open “My Posted Rides.” 

See all your rides, booked seats, and rider information. 

Edit or cancel rides if needed. 

 

7. Rating Drivers and Riders 

After completing a ride, you can leave a rating. 

Go to “My Rides” or “My Posted Rides.” 

Select the ride you completed. 

Tap “Rate Driver” or “Rate Rider.” 

Choose a star rating and submit. 

Ratings help build trust and identify safe, reliable users. 

 

8. Emergency Contacts 

CarShare includes an Emergency Contacts page for safety. 

To access: 

Open the side menu. 

Select “Emergency Contacts.” 

You will see: 

AUBH Security Office 

AUBH Campus Guards 

Bahrain Police Hotline 

Students can use these numbers if they feel unsafe during a trip. 

 

9. Managing Your Account 

9.1 Editing Profile Information 

Open Settings. 

Update your display name, phone number, or car details (drivers only). 

Changes save automatically. 
